      "text": "can woman forget sucking child, that she have not compassion on son of her womb, 1 Ne. 21:15 (Isa. 49:15). the Son is filled with compassion toward children of men, Mosiah 15:9. Lamanites have compassion on people of Limhi, Mosiah 19:14 (20:26). Lamanites have compassion on Amulon and brethren, Mosiah 23:34. Ammon2 and brethren moved with compassion by destruction among people, Alma 27:4. Christ’s bowels are filled with compassion toward Nephites, 3 Ne. 17:6. the Lord had compassion upon Jared2, Ether 1:35.",
